- Most annotations work the same way
- Some new features available

### 3. Dialect Configuration
```properties
# application.properties
spring.jpa.database-platform=org.hibernate.dialect.PostgreSQL10Dialect
# Or let Hibernate auto-detect
spring.jpa.database-platform=org.hibernate.dialect.Database.getDialect()
```

### 4. Entity Configuration
```java
@Entity
@Table(name = "users")
public class User {
    @Id
    @GeneratedValue(strategy = GenerationType.IDENTITY)
    private Long id;

    @Column(nullable = false)
    private String username;

    // Getters and setters
}
```

### 5. Query Changes
```java
// HQL queries work the same
@Query("SELECT u FROM User u WHERE u.username = :username")
User findByUsername(@Param("username") String username);
```

### 6. Common Issues
- Ensure all entity classes use jakarta.persistence imports
- Update custom Hibernate types if using them
- Test database operations thoroughly
